WEBVTT

00:06:26.882 --> 00:06:31.512
Whenever Congress and the president
agree to spend more,

00:06:31.554 --> 00:06:34.390
the government's bank,
the Federal Reserve,

00:06:34.432 --> 00:06:37.309
works with the rest
of the financial system

00:06:37.309 --> 00:06:40.020
to get that money into our accounts.

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:43.524
Everything's done electronically,

00:06:43.524 --> 00:06:46.902
so there's no physical printing
of money involved.

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:51.532
If you got a 1,400-dollar check
from the federal government

00:06:51.532 --> 00:06:53.409
earlier this year,

00:06:53.409 --> 00:06:59.165
or if your company received money
to help cover payroll and other expenses,

00:06:59.206 --> 00:07:04.837
then you received some
of the newly minted digital dollars